{"id":17907,"date":"2023-07-03T16:03:46","date_gmt":"2023-07-03T22:03:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17907"},"modified":"2025-02-04T18:22:30","modified_gmt":"2025-02-04T23:22:30","slug":"newsletter-july-2023-vol-7-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-july-2023-vol-7-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: July 2023 (Vol 7.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17907\" class=\"elementor elementor-17907\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-33c4e1c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"33c4e1c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6fddf71\" data-id=\"6fddf71\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1468a29 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1468a29\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 50px;\">Happy 4th of July! We hope you&#8217;re staying warm in the heat this summer. Need a feel good story to get you through it? Check out our &#8220;People Making a Difference&#8221; story below!<\/p><h2 style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">Here&#8217;s what we&#8217;re reading!<\/h2><p>Check out what the Rethink BH team is reading this month!<\/p><p><strong>Erin Mayberry<\/strong>, Director of Community Engagement: Muluneh, M.G. (2021). <a href=\"https:\/\/agricultureandfoodsecurity.biomedcentral.com\/articles\/10.1186\/s40066-021-00318-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Impact of climate change on biodiversity and food security: a global perspective &#8211; a review article<\/a>. <em>Agriculture and Food Security,<\/em> 10:36.<\/p><p><strong>Nick Green<\/strong>, unofficial Data Unicorn: <a href=\"https:\/\/shop.datavisualizationsociety.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nightingale Magazine, Issue 3<\/a> &#8211; <em>The journal of the Data Visualization Society<\/em>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3bf7848 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3bf7848\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-eb5b038\" data-id=\"eb5b038\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a88888f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a88888f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright\" style=\"margin-top: -7%; max-width: 315px !important; border-radius: 100%; padding: 15px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/employee-spotlight-joy-helsel-customer-success-manager.jpg\" alt=\"Joy Helsel\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">Joy Helsel<em>, Customer Success Manager<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> Mount Joy, PA<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Family:<\/strong> 1 cat, 1 dog, 2 children<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite Food:<\/strong> any kind of seafood<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite Food:<\/strong> Beatles<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>If you could be any superhero, who would you be and why?<\/strong> Professor X, so that I could read minds.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite place you&#8217;ve traveled:<\/strong> I just got back from Puerto Rico so that is probably my new favorite. My husband\u2019s uncle, whom we were very close to, just passed away and he was from PR, so it was very special to be able to travel there just before his passing. It is also an amazingly beautiful island.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-318180e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"318180e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>People Making a Difference<\/h2><p><em>Jen &amp; Caleb<\/em><\/p><p><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">In April, Rethink shared stories on our <\/span><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">ABA After Hours<\/span><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"> podcast from professionals and families impacted by autism to celebrate <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/dont-just-be-aware-autism-acceptance-month\/\">Autism Awareness &amp; Acceptance Month<\/a>. One of those families was Jen and Caleb, a mother-and-son duo living in rural Virginia.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">When we initially reached out to invite Jen and Caleb to our podcast, Jen regretfully declined, saying she did not think they were a good fit as Caleb was 13 years old and had never received ABA services, despite being on waiting lists for several years with local companies. We thought this was just as important to share, as children with autism living in rural areas of the U.S. are less likely to receive timely and medically necessary treatment. <\/span><a class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-underline text-strikethrough-none\" draggable=\"false\" href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/episode\/3Tw2nmApMoiVFatBCwryS2?si=u5A3IcpySquOZAs6bPkkPA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Caleb joined our podcast<\/a><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"> and told his story, saying he wished his classmates would not be rude, and that thinking differently is ok. His mom shared that one of her biggest concerns was the lack of education of the school staff on special education and autism in general. She said beyond her son, there were countless children being pushed aside through a lack of resources in their community. Rethink was able to share parent resources with her and even connected her with an ABA company with availability, but the company was unfortunately not a fit due to their extremely rural location.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">A few weeks after the podcast aired, Jen reached out to update us that she had been emailing their state governor about the lack of resources in schools in her community. She shared the podcast and received a response from the governor&#8217;s office and the Virginia Board of Education offering assistance and considering training and education for public school employees.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Since then, Jen has shared the podcast with others, and through that has been connected with a behavioral health organization with immediate openings. In her last IEP meeting, she was able to successfully advocate for and secure a full time aide for Caleb next school year, extended school time to allow him to complete assignments virtually as needed, and a behavior plan including scheduled breaks, staff responses to identified triggers, and communication strategies for both him and his school staff.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"_04xlpA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Jen and Caleb remind us that Autism Awareness and Acceptance are just the first step in Action and Accountability. Thank you for sharing your story with us, Jen and Caleb! You are truly remarkable!<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9391e4 elementor-blockquote--skin-quotation elementor-blockquote--align-center elementor-blockquote--button-skin-link elementor-blockquote--button-view-icon-text elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"b9391e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"blockquote.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"elementor-blockquote\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-blockquote__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\"Find a cure for allergies, be happy, have many different jobs - be a police officer dressed like Spiderman, a plumber like Mario, a paleontologist, and a Ghostbuster!\"\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-q-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<cite class=\"elementor-blockquote__author\">Caleb, when asked what he wanted to do when he grew up<\/cite>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/intent\/tweet?text=%22Find+a+cure+for+allergies%2C+be+happy%2C+have+many+different+jobs+-+be+a+police+officer+dressed+like+Spiderman%2C+a+plumber+like+Mario%2C+a+paleontologist%2C+and+a+Ghostbuster%21%22+%E2%80%94+Caleb%2C+when+asked+what+he+wanted+to+do+when+he+grew+up&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com%2Fnews-events%2Fnewsletter-july-2023-vol-7-23%2F\" class=\"elementor-blockquote__tweet-button\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fab fa-twitter\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-blockquote__tweet-label\">Share this<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a5a7c2 vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9a5a7c2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full alignleft\" style=\"margin-right: 30px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/july-20230-events.png\" alt=\"Fireworks icon\" width=\"125\" height=\"auto\" \/>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 20px\" >July 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-5e9ffcf elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5e9ffcf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-ceb89e1\" data-id=\"ceb89e1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a91f97 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2a91f97\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/melissa-druskis-founder-ceo-abc-behavior-training.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15544\" alt=\"Melissa Druskis, founder &amp; CEO of ABC Behavior Training\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/melissa-druskis-founder-ceo-abc-behavior-training.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/melissa-druskis-founder-ceo-abc-behavior-training-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/melissa-druskis-founder-ceo-abc-behavior-training-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b9725ab\" data-id=\"b9725ab\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0188392 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0188392\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>5 Ways to Boost Staff Productivity Using ABA<\/h3><p><strong>July 13th @ 1:00 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Authorized hours left on the table due to low staff productivity can greatly impact client progress, your company\u2019s finances, and parent satisfaction. Melissa Druskis, founder &amp; CEO of <\/span><a class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-underline text-strikethrough-none\" draggable=\"false\" href=\"https:\/\/www.abcbehaviortx.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ABC Behavior Training<\/a><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">, will show you how to improve your staff\u2019s productivity by using strategic systems of training, performance monitoring, and reinforcement.<\/span><\/p><p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/get.rethinkbh.com\/suc-0713-melissad-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Register for FREE CE Event<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-c074dcf elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c074dcf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-e2cee84\" data-id=\"e2cee84\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3341822 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3341822\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Radical Values<\/h3><p><strong>July 18th @ 1:00 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Explore the impact of misalignments in personal and professional values as an underlying cause of perpetual burnout among ABA professionals on the next episode of <\/span><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Our Next Guest<\/span><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">. Portia James, Founder &amp; CEO of <\/span><a class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-underline text-strikethrough-none\" draggable=\"false\" href=\"https:\/\/www.behaviorgenius.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Behavior Genius<\/a><span class=\"WdYUQQ text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">, joins Dr. Bridget Taylor to discuss how we can pinpoint misalignments and take actionable steps toward reducing burnout.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/radical-values-impacts-misaligned-values-aba-professionals\/\">Learn More and View On-Demand Webinar<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-2aea53f\" data-id=\"2aea53f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba5fa34 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ba5fa34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/portia-james-founder-ceo-behavior-genius.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full